     * a channel list because it genuinely is one: bit N routes channel N.
     *
     * **A hard prerequisite for every end-to-end operation, enforced by
     * deadlock** on the event-wait profile. Completion IS the interrupt, so a
     * test that routes nothing raises no interrupt, nothing calls
